	(text "MCU (3.3 V) -> 5 V logic: 74AHCT125 (TTL input levels).   5 V sense chain -> MCU: 74LVC1G125 at 3.3 V.\nPull-ups keep OE5_N, BIAS_EN and STIM_EN inactive while the MCU is in reset (review F6); pull-downs keep\nSCK and RCLK from clocking the chain while the MCU pins float."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
